OL,3,GNEWSAPlane stuck in grass at Heathrow
OL,4,Abefore take-off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Airways plane became stuck in
OL,7,Fthe grass at Heathrow Airport after it
OL,8,Fveered off the taxiway.
OL,10,FThe Boeing 787 Dreamliner bound for
OL,11,FLagos became stuck after its front
OL,12,Fwheel entered the grass shortly after
OL,13,F10:00 GMT.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the west London
OL,16,Fairport said they were continuing to
OL,17,Fassist the plane back to the aircraft
OL,18,Fparking area, adding that there were no
OL,19,Finjuries and no impact on wider
OL,20,Foperations.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
