OL,3,GNEWSAPlane stuck in grass at Heathrow
OL,4,Abefore take-off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for BA said: "We're very
OL,7,Fsorry to our customers for the
OL,8,Fdisruption to their flight. Our teams
OL,9,Fare working to get them on their way as
OL,10,Fquickly as possible and are in touch
OL,11,Fwith them to put things right."
